      "duration": 6.748,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那攻防对抗不就进入自动化时代了嘛！",
      "start": 258.49,
      "duration": 3.439,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_027_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "是的。但你别光觉得防守方有AI，攻击方也有。 这意味着黑客的门槛大幅降低了，以前要当黑客得学很多技术，现在可能写几行提示词就能发动一次复杂的攻击。",
      "start": 262.368,
      "duration": 13.995,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "啊？ 那普通人岂不是更容易中招？",
      "start": 276.775,
      "duration": 3.57,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "所以这其实是一场军备竞赛。防守方和攻击方都在卷AI能力，谁能先训练出更聪明的智能体，谁就占据上风。 这次国产智能体上榜，至少说明咱们没在这场竞赛里掉队。",
      "start": 280.838,
      "duration": 16.041,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "懂了。对了，说到智能体，周鸿祎最近也搞了个大动作，你知道吗？",
      "start": 297.288,
      "duration": 5.442,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "纳米Work企业智能体平台对吧？360加码B端AI赛道的那个。",
      "start": 303.217,
      "duration": 5.79,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对！主打企业级Agent协同工作。我感觉这两年大厂都在往Agent这个方向发力。",
      "start": 309.449,
      "duration": 7.75,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "嗯，因为单纯的大模型对话已经不够用了。企业真正需要的是能帮他们完成具体任务的智能体，比如自动处理工单、自动生成报告、自动协调流程。",
      "start": 317.659,
      "duration": 12.123,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那种就像一个虚拟员工？",
