      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_037_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这就得看周鸿祎他们怎么定价了。如果能提供开箱即用、按需付费的解决方案，对中小企业的数字化转型确实是个大利好。",
      "start": 348.476,
      "duration": 10.188,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_038_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "还有一个快讯特别有意思。就是Opus 5有个游戏提示词，据说24小时就能复刻一款3A大作？",
      "start": 359.104,
      "duration": 9.056,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_039_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个我看了网友的分享，确实很火爆。百万网友都在玩各种自己复刻出来的游戏版本。",
      "start": 368.638,
      "duration": 8.49,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_040_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "真的假的？24小时就复刻3A大作？这也太夸张了吧。",
      "start": 377.609,
      "duration": 5.224,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_041_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_041_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，这里面有几个关键点。第一，它不是真的从零开始写3A引擎，而是用提示词调动Opus 5的能力去生成游戏的各种元素。第二，所谓的\"复刻\"其实是指生成类似风格和机制的游戏，而不是像素级复制原版。",
      "start": 383.259,
      "duration": 22.267,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_042_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_042_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
